{"id":"n18772-1-32","stage":1,"title":"택시 · 出租车","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18772-1-32-1","ko":"술 한잔했으니 택시를 타고 집에 가자.","zh":"既然已经喝过酒了，咱们打车回家吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"술","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한잔했으니","meaning":"喝一杯","explanation":"한잔하다：喝一杯；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"한잔하다","audio":"/audio/0daf602b903f50885a5b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62372","senseId":"1","lemma":"한잔하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"택시를","meaning":"出租车","explanation":"택시：出租车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"택시","audio":"/audio/94be61a73763ee4ccdbe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18772","senseId":"1","lemma":"택시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"타고","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가자.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"803d2c68651cecea","term":"술","zh":"酒","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3","entryId":"65157","definition":"像啤酒或烧酒等那样含有酒精成分、喝后会醉的饮料。","pronunciation":["술"]},{"id":"0daf602b903f5088","term":"한잔하다","zh":"喝一杯","audio":"/audio/0daf602b903f50885a5b.mp3","entryId":"62372","definition":"稍微喝一场茶、酒等。","pronunciation":["한잔하다"]},{"id":"94be61a73763ee4c","term":"택시","zh":"出租车","audio":"/audio/94be61a73763ee4ccdbe.mp3","entryId":"18772","definition":"收费后，将客人送到其指定地点的汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/29df0c0307e2fec4619d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18772-1-32-2","ko":"주말 밤이라 그런지 택시가 잘 안 잡히네.","zh":"可能是周末的晚上，出租车很难叫到呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주말","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밤이라","meaning":"夜，夜间","explanation":"밤：夜，夜间；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"밤","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74178","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그런지","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"택시가","meaning":"出租车","explanation":"택시：出租车；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"택시","audio":"/audio/94be61a73763ee4ccdbe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18772","senseId":"1","lemma":"택시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잡히네.","meaning":"叫到，打到","explanation":"잡히다：叫到，打到；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"잡히다","audio":"/audio/4e82277a09474ac2305e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70656","senseId":"4","lemma":"잡히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"da9e530428ce1c2d","term":"밤","zh":"夜，夜间","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3","entryId":"74178","definition":"日落到第二天日出前的黑暗时段。","pronunciation":["밤"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"94be61a73763ee4c","term":"택시","zh":"出租车","audio":"/audio/94be61a73763ee4ccdbe.mp3","entryId":"18772","definition":"收费后，将客人送到其指定地点的汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"容易","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"性质或倾向较易成为某种状态或进行某种行动地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"4e82277a09474ac2","term":"잡히다","zh":"叫到，打到","audio":"/audio/4e82277a09474ac2305e.mp3","entryId":"70656","definition":"汽车等停下以让人上车乘坐。","pronunciation":["자피다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6d4c8f455c0f38f1119d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.732,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=18772","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":51,"sequenceSc